            <p class="text-lg font-semibold">Hampton Roads talent and excellence.</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed">
              Hampton Roads DevFest is the region's one-day developer conference, built to show what Hampton Roads developers can do. Local developers, engineers, veterans, and students come together to learn from each other, connect, and meet the companies building technology here. DevFest 2026 was a near sell out.
            </p>
