          <div class="bp-surface">
            <p class="bp-label mb-3">For 2027</p>
            <ul class="flex flex-col divide-y divide-[var(--bp-line-faint)] border-y border-[var(--bp-line-faint)] text-base leading-relaxed">
              <li class="py-3"><strong>Local talent on stage.</strong> DevFest is single track, in one room. Every speaker is a keynote, and everyone sees every talk.</li>
              <li class="py-3"><strong>Showing what's built here.</strong> Talks cover a range of topics, including AI, alongside the rest of what Hampton Roads developers work on every day.</li>
              <li class="py-3"><strong>The Studio.</strong> An open room for hanging out and lunch, where many of the day's conversations happen.</li>
              <li class="py-3"><strong>Real time with attendees.</strong> Registration networking, two 30-minute breaks at the sponsor tables, and a 75-minute lunch.</li>
              <li class="py-3"><strong>The next generation of local talent.</strong> Many attendees come on Veteran and Student Scholarships, funded directly by sponsors. The Scholar Meetup at lunch, optional for scholars, connects them with the companies that sponsored their seats.</li>
            </ul>
